:name: Demo board
:description: Sample script exercising the highlighting rules.

# Variables: ?= only assigns when unset, so callers can override.
$name?="demo"
$bin?=@firmware/app.elf
$repl?=@$ORIGIN/platform.repl

using sysbus

mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $repl

sysbus LoadELF $bin
cpu PC 0x08000000

# Host-facing UART: pass false to disable Telnet negotiation.
emulation CreateServerSocketTerminal 3456 "term" false
connector Connect sysbus.uart0 term
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2

logLevel -1 sysbus.spi
sysbus LogPeripheralAccess sysbus.spi
logFile @/tmp/renode.log

machine StartGdbServer 3333
emulation SetGlobalQuantum "0.000100"

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu PC 0x08000000
"""

runMacro $reset
start
